  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Expert - FPI, Bryssel - National Expert - FPI EEAS, Bryssel, JB</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationell Expert - FPI, Bryssel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen skall st&#xf6;dja IcSP (Stability and Peace) som &#xe4;r ett viktigt instrument i EU f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rebygga och reagera p&#xe5; kriser och skapa en s&#xe4;ker och stabil milj&#xf6;. Instrumentet fokuserar p&#xe5; konfliktf&#xf6;rebyggande, krishantering och fredsbyggande.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution support the IcSP (Stability and Peace), which is an important instrument in the EU for preventing and responding to crises and creating a safe and stable environment. The instrument focuses on conflict prevention, crisis management and peace-building.</narrative>
  </description>
